#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "72_RA"
msgid "Shit!"
msgstr "¡Mierda!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "84_Kiryu"
msgid "I think it's about time I meet with your boss. He's stronger than you, right? Why're you trying to hide him, anyways?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "96_RA"
msgid "Heh... This is where I say goodbye, Mika."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "108_Mika"
msgid "I've gotta say, I'm shocked at what a totally useless wimp you turned out to be."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "120_Mika"
msgid "For someone who boasted about what a cinch taking Kamurocho would be, you let me down."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "132_RA"
msgid "Heheh... See ya, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "144_Kiryu"
msgid "Hey! Tell me where your boss is!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "156_Mika"
msgid "Would you take a hint already, old man!? She's right in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "168_Kiryu"
msgid "You!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "180_Mika"
msgid "Are you deaf or something? I'm the boss of the Kanto Gangsters. The name's Mika."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "192_Kiryu"
msgid "What do you mean...?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "204_Mika"
msgid "You still don't get it? I thought the Legendary Yakuza would be quicker on the uptake."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "216_Mika"
msgid "I use old boyfriends like RA as a front, while I lead from behind. That's how our gang really works."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "228_Kiryu"
msgid "What's the point of that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "240_Mika"
msgid "If it got out that the boss was a chick, the other gangs would come try and pick a fight with us. I didn't want to deal with that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "252_Mika"
msgid "Fooling around with this gang is just a hobby of mine. Things got a little out of hand this time, but I sure had fun."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "264_Kiryu"
msgid "If that's all you care about, why bother with a tough town like Kamurocho?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "276_Mika"
msgid "That's got nothing to do with me. RA was all excited about something that was going down in Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "288_Mika"
msgid "He started acting all tough, saying, \"I'm gonna make you the queen of Kamurocho!\" What a joke that was. You men are all morons."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "300_Kiryu"
msgid "So what're you going to do now? Don't tell me I have to fight you too?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "312_Mika"
msgid "Haha! You're hilarious! I mean, how can you even say that with a straight face?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "324_Mika"
msgid "I wish someone had taken you down before my true identity got out, but now everything's changed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "336_Mika"
msgid "There's not much point in keeping this up if the Tojo Clan's Fourth Chairman is after me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "348_Mika"
msgid "As of today, the Kanto Gangsters are no more! I'll find some other way to have fun. See ya."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "372_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "384_Mika"
msgid "Oh, and Fourth Chairman? I should tell you that just before I showed up in Kamurocho, a kind of strange message came my way."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "¿Sí?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "408_Mika"
msgid "It said that if we defeated you, we could have all the money we wanted."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "420_Mika"
msgid "Of course, it was RA they contacted since he was supposed to be the boss. He was planning to use some of that money for the bounty he offered."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "432_Mika"
msgid "Looks like somebody's backing the gangs that are trying to take you down. I'd watch my back if I were you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "444_Kiryu"
msgid "Hold on! Who's behind this?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "456_Mika"
msgid "Beats me."
msgstr "Quién sabe."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "468_Mika"
msgid "They just contacted us through RA's cell phone. RA's never even met them, so there's no point in going after him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "480_Mika"
msgid "Well, it's about time for me to be on my way. Later."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "540_Akaishi"
msgid "Hmm... To think the boss was a woman."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "552_Akaishi"
msgid "So, everything we had heard about the boss all came from her former boyfriends? Women truly are frightening."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "564_Kiryu"
msgid "They can be. Anyway, they won't be a problem now. Still, I don't understand the younger generation and their frivolous attitudes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "576_Akaishi"
msgid "Actually, I'm more concerned about the message Mika mentioned. Someone's offering money to whoever defeats you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "588_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah... But there's nothing we can do with that information alone."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "600_Akaishi"
msgid "Right. We'll just have to wait and see then. The Kamurocho Guard will do whatever it can to gather more information."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "612_Kiryu"
msgid "I'd appreciate that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "624_Akaishi"
msgid "Still, we couldn't even figure out that the boss was a woman, so please don't get your hopes up."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "636_Akaishi"
msgid "Oh, but we did hear that some holdouts from the Kanto Gangsters are still here in town."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "648_Akaishi"
msgid "Please take care of yourself. Also, here's your reward."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "696_Akaishi"
msgid "This equipment is from the shop owner you helped. He asked me to thank you for getting rid of the gang around his store."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "708_Akaishi"
msgid "We'll be seeing you. Your help is always appreciated."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "780_Gangster-looking Man"
msgid "Uh-oh, they're on to us. What should we do, Mika?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "792_Woman Called Mika"
msgid "This all happened because you opened your big mouth and started offering a bounty on him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "804_Woman Called Mika"
msgid "Instead, you put a target on your own head."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "816_Gangster-looking Man"
msgid "Huh? You think it's my fault? We just got unlucky!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "828_Kiryu"
msgid "A bounty? So you're RA?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "840_Gangster-looking Man"
msgid "Shit, this guy even knows my name? Man, did I really blow this? This is bad..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "852_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, what's your next move? I get the feeling you're not all that serious about taking over Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "864_RA"
msgid "Oh, yeah? I'm serious all right. Boss's orders."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "876_Kiryu"
msgid "Boss? You're not the boss? Where is he then?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "888_RA"
msgid "Ah, who cares about that guy?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "900_Mika"
msgid "I wouldn't say that about the boss if I were you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "912_RA"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, my bad. Anyway, sorry for the wait, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "924_RA"
msgid "The others are gonna be bummed after I take you out 'cause then there won't be a bounty to collect anymore. But, oh well. Life's a bitch, then you die."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "936_RA"
msgid "Thought we could have some fun getting everybody psyched for our little Kiryu Hunt. Too bad."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "948_Kiryu"
msgid "You mean you're going to take me on?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "960_RA"
msgid "Looks like I'm the only one who can. I've been watching you from up here, you're pretty damn strong."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "972_RA"
msgid "After the third fight or so, I kind of figured it'd have to be someone really strong."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "984_Kiryu"
msgid "And you're the strongest one in your gang?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "996_RA"
msgid "Sorta. Anyway, don't want to keep the boss waiting, so let's head into the final round!"
msgstr ""

